  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A horizontal force of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"100\\; \\textup{N}\"></span> is applied to a metal sphere of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5.0\\; \\textup{kg}\"></span> and radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"30\\; \\textup{cm}\"></span> to horizontally accelerate the sphere through a fluid. The instant when the acceleration of the sphere is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8.0\\: \\textup{m\\,s}^{-2}\"></span>, its speed is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"25\\: \\textup{m\\,s}^{-1}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the best estimate for the coefficient of viscosity of the liquid?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"200\\: \\textup{mPa\\,s}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"400\\: \\textup{mPa\\,s}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"700\\: \\textup{mPa\\,s}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1300\\: \\textup{mPa\\,s}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
